  "statuteText": "198:23 Tuition Paid to School District. –\n\nWhen a child has been placed in a home by the children and youth services division of the department of health and human services or by a licensed child-placing agency, the school district in which said home is located shall be entitled to the funds provided under the provisions of this subdivision."
